# PHPStan baseline — a DEBT LEDGER, not a silencer.
#
# Every entry here is a finding that existed when static analysis was introduced. They are
# listed so that EXISTING code does not block the build while NEW code is still checked at
# level 5 from day one.
#
# The rule: this file only ever shrinks. If a build fails, fix the code — do not regenerate
# this file to make the failure disappear, because that also erases everything else it was
# tracking.

